<item><title><![CDATA[Main Character Syndrome]]></title><description><![CDATA[This guest post is for you if you've ever considered despite having modern people in ancient times, we still have ancient people in modern times.]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Becario]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:40:43 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don&#8217;t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</em></p><p>En el cap&#237;tulo de hoy de comprensi&#243;n lectora seguimos hablando de los primeros pasos de la ciencia moderna.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg" width="761" height="1200" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1200,&quot;width&quot;:761,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:110191,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Statue of Aristharcus&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/214926167?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="Statue of Aristharcus" title="Statue of Aristharcus" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q4um!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33018035-893c-4ba6-ad85-ed45826e9c85_761x1200.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Aristarchus of Samos, monument at the Aristotle University of Thessaloniki. Source: Wikimedia Commons</figcaption></figure></div><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p></p><p>Mucho antes de Cop&#233;rnico, hace unos 2300 a&#241;os, un astr&#243;nomo griego llamado Aristarco propuso una idea incre&#237;ble para su &#233;poca: quiz&#225; la Tierra no fuera el centro del universo.</p><p></p><p>Aristarco, que naci&#243; en el a&#241;o 310 antes de Cristo (a.C.), observ&#243; el movimiento aparente del Sol, la Luna y las estrellas y lleg&#243; a considerar que pod&#237;a explicarse mejor si la Tierra giraba sobre su propio eje y se desplazaba alrededor del Sol. &#161;La idea era revolucionaria!</p><p></p><p>Para una persona que observa el cielo desde la Tierra, parece evidente que nosotros estamos quietos mientras el Sol atraviesa el cielo cada d&#237;a. Las estrellas tambi&#233;n parecen girar a nuestro alrededor. Pero Aristarco se atrevi&#243; a preguntar si esa apariencia pod&#237;a ser enga&#241;osa.</p><p></p><p>Su propuesta colocaba al Sol en el centro del sistema y convert&#237;a a la Tierra en un planeta m&#225;s. Tambi&#233;n reconoc&#237;a que las estrellas pod&#237;an estar much&#237;simo m&#225;s lejos de nosotros de lo que imaginaban sus contempor&#225;neos. La idea no se convirti&#243; en la visi&#243;n dominante del mundo antiguo. Durante muchos siglos prevaleci&#243; un modelo en el que la Tierra ocupaba una posici&#243;n central. Much&#237;simo despu&#233;s, Cop&#233;rnico retom&#243; la misma idea. Su obra se public&#243; el d&#237;a de su muerte, en 1543, y estuvo prohibido desde 1616 hasta 1835.</p><p></p><p>Aristarco fue un cient&#237;fico muy avanzado para su tiempo. Logr&#243; imaginar una realidad completamente diferente porque se atrevi&#243; a dudar de las cosas que parec&#237;an obvias para todos los dem&#225;s. Esta historia nos muestra algo muy importante sobre la ciencia. A veces, para descubrir la verdad y entender el mundo, el primer paso es dudar de lo que nos dice nuestro propio sentido com&#250;n.</p></div><h2>Cuestionario de autoevaluaci&#243;n</h2><p>Veamos qu&#233; tal se te ha dado. No pasa nada si no has entendido todo a la primera. Intenta contestar todas las preguntas, y vuelve a repasar el texto si te falta alguna respuesta. &#161;Mucho &#225;nimo!</p><p>Suscr&#237;bete gratuitamente para ver el cuestionario. Y si te parece que el contenido lo vale, merece la pena, y te lo puedes permitir, tambi&#233;n puedes convertirte en suscriptor de pago para ayudar a que sigamos creando m&#225;s contenido como este.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>El cuestionario contiene preguntas de tipo test para evaluar tu comprensi&#243;n lectora.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary button-wrapper" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Si te ha parecido interesante suscr&#237;bete, comparte, deja tus comentarios, o dale a &#8220;Like &#10084;&#65039;&#8221;. Eso nos ayuda a crecer y a seguir motivados, y te lo agradeceremos de coraz&#243;n.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-aristarchus-of/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p><strong>&#191;Y t&#250;? &#191;Conoc&#237;as la historia de Aristarco de Samos?</strong></p>]]></content:encoded></item>